{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s31-p01",
      "text": "Do you have difficulty falling asleep at night?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p02",
      "text": "If so, here's a piece of advice for you: Listen to some soft music.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p03",
      "text": "Scientists have found that soft music can help to improve sleep quality and quantity.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p04",
      "text": "This works for sleepers of all ages, and especially for those with sleeping problems.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p05-01",
      "text": "Soft music can help us fall asleep better,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p05-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p05-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p05-02",
      "text": "wake up less during the night,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p05-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p05-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p05-03",
      "text": "and feel more relaxed in the morning.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p05-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p05-03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p06",
      "text": "You may not notice the effects overnight, though.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p07",
      "text": "It could take as many as 3 weeks to see any improvements.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p08",
      "text": "Why can soft music help us sleep better?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p09",
      "text": "The reasons aren't clear yet.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p10",
      "text": "It may connect with the relaxing effect of a good song.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p11",
      "text": "Music can have real physical effects, too.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p12",
      "text": "Soft music can lower our heart rate and slow down our breathing.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p13",
      "text": "This prepares us for sleep.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p14",
      "text": "Scientists say that for most people, music that has 70 beats per minute works best.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p15",
      "text": "Classical, jazz and folk music are usually more effective than other musical styles.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p16",
      "text": "Familiar songs work well, too.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p17",
      "text": "You may need to test to make your own playlists.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p18",
      "text": "And remember to get the volume right.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p19",
      "text": "Make sure that the final piece is gradually slowing down, or you may be woken up by the sudden silence.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p20",
      "text": "It's very important to get enough high-quality sleep.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p21",
      "text": "Before you go to bed tonight, play some soft music.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s31-p22",
      "text": "Then, just prepare to be rocked off to dreamland.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s31-p22.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
